         it try to found last synched rev  wich from to push in current svn branch;
     if --hg-follow defined, then it try to switch svn to current hg branch, and 
         find last synched revision
-    if peg revision defined, then it switches svn to it, and start push\pull into it 
+    if peg revision defined, then it switches svn to it, and start push/pull into it
         from current hg revision
 
