         in contrast standart behaviour requires to pull from current svn revision
     
 *   ``hgpushsvn --svnignore-use`` - append node to .hgsvn/.svnignore - list of files wich is ignored 
-                from push\pull process. ordinary there should be .hgtags
+                from push/pull process. ordinary there should be .hgtags
 
